    </schema>
    <schema>
      <key>/schemas/desktop/gnome/url-handlers/trash/needs_terminal</key>
      <applyto>/desktop/gnome/url-handlers/trash/needs_terminal</applyto>
      <owner>gnome</owner>
      <type>bool</type>
      <default>false</default>
      <locale name="C">
        <short>Run program in terminal</short>
        <long>True if the program to handle this URL should be run in a terminal.</long>
      </locale>

      <locale name="af">
        <short>Laat program in terminaal loop</short>
        <long>Waar as die program wat hierdie URL moet hanteer, in &apos;n terminaal laat loop moet word.</long>
      </locale>

      <locale name="ar">
        <short>تشغيل البرنامج في شاشة طرفية</short>
        <long>True إذا وجب تشغيل برنامج معالجة هذا العنوان في شاشة طرفية.</long>
      </locale>

      <locale name="az">
        <short>Proqramı terminalda işə sal</short>
        <long>True if the program to handle this URL should be run in a terminal.</long>
      </locale>

      <locale name="bg">
        <short>Пуска програма в терминала</short>
        <long>Включено, ако програмата, която ще обработва това URL трябва да бъде пусната в конзола.</long>
      </locale>

      <locale name="bn">
        <short>টার্মিনালে প্রোগ্রাম চালাও</short>
        <long>এই ইউ-আর-এল সামলানোর প্রোগ্রামটিকে টার্মিনালে চালাতে চাইলে সত্য হিসাবে নির্ধারণ করুন</long>
      </locale>

      <locale name="ca">
        <short>Executa el programa en un terminal</short>
        <long>Vertader si el programa per a gestionar aquest URL hauria d&apos;executar-se en un terminal.</long>
      </locale>

      <locale name="cs">
        <short>Spustit program v terminálu</short>
        <long>True, pokud by měl být program pro obsluhu tohoto URL spouštěn v terminálu.</long>
      </locale>

      <locale name="cy">
        <short>Rhedeg rhaglen mewn terfynell</short>
        <long>Gwir os dylid rhedeg y rhaglen sy&apos;n delio â&apos;r math yma o LAU mewn terfynell.</long>
      </locale>

      <locale name="da">
        <short>Kør program i terminal</short>
        <long>Sand hvis programmet til at håndtere denne adresse skal køres i en terminal.</long>
      </locale>

      <locale name="de">
        <short>Programm im Terminal ausführen</short>
        <long>Falls dieser Schlüssel wahr ist, wird das Programm, dass diese URL handhaben soll, in einem Terminal ausgeführt.</long>
      </locale>

      <locale name="el">
        <short>Εκτέλεση προγράμματος σε τερματικό</short>
        <long>True αν το πρόγραμμα για το χειρισμό του URL θα πρέπει να εκτελείται σε τερματικό.</long>
      </locale>

      <locale name="en_CA">
        <short>Run program in terminal</short>
        <long>True if the program to handle this URL should be run in a terminal.</long>
      </locale>

      <locale name="en_GB">
        <short>Run program in terminal</short>
        <long>True if the program to handle this URL should be run in a terminal.</long>
      </locale>

      <locale name="es">
        <short>Ejecutar programa en terminal</short>
        <long>Verdadero si el programa que manipula esta URL debe ejecutarse en un terminal.</long>
      </locale>

      <locale name="fi">
        <short>Suorita sovellus päätteessä</short>
        <long>Tosi, jos tämän URL:n käsittelevä ohjelma tulisi käynnistää päätteessä.</long>
      </locale>

      <locale name="fr">
        <short>Lancer le programme dans un terminal</short>
        <long>Vrai si le programme qui gère cette URL doit être lancée dans un terminal.</long>
      </locale>

      <locale name="gu">
        <short>ટર્મિનલમાં કાર્યક્રમ ચલાવો</short>
        <long>સાચુ જો આ URLના હેન્ડલ માટેનો કાર્યક્રમ ટર્મિનલમાં ચલાવાશે.</long>
      </locale>

      <locale name="he">
        <short>הפעל תוכנית במסוף</short>
        
      </locale>

      <locale name="hr">
        <short>Pokreni program u treminalu</short>
        <long>Postavite ako program treba raditi s ovim URL-om u terminalu.</long>
      </locale>

      <locale name="it">
        <short>Eseguire programma nel terminale</short>
        <long>Impostare a vero se il programma che gestisce quest&apos;URL deve essere eseguito in un terminale.</long>
      </locale>

      <locale name="ja">
        <short>端末でプログラムを実行するかどうか</short>
        <long>この URL を扱うプログラムを端末内で実行する場合は TRUE にします。</long>
      </locale>

      <locale name="ko">
        <short>터미널에서 프로그램을 실행합니다</short>
        <long>참이면, 이 URL을 처리하는 프로그램을 터미널에서 실행해야 하는 경우입니다.</long>
      </locale>

      <locale name="lt">
        <short>Paleisti programą terminale</short>
        <long>Teigiamas, jei programai apdorojančiai šį adresą būtinas terminalas.</long>
      </locale>

      <locale name="mn">
        <short>Програмыг терминалд ажиллуулах</short>
        <long>Энэ түлхүүр үнэн бол, энэ URL терминалд ажиллана.</long>
      </locale>

      <locale name="ms">
        <short>Laksana program pada terminal</short>
        <long>Benar jika program yang mengendali URL ini patut dilaksanakan pada terminal.</long>
      </locale>

      <locale name="nl">
        <short>Programma in terminal starten</short>
        <long>Indien waar, moet het programma wat deze URL afhandelt in een terminal gestart worden.</long>
      </locale>

      <locale name="nn">
        <short>Køyr program i terminal</short>
        <long>Sann dersom programmet som handsamar denne URL-en skal køyrast i ein terminal.</long>
      </locale>

      <locale name="no">
        <short>Kjør program i terminal</short>
        <long>Sann hvis programmet for å håndtere denne URLen skal kjøres i en terminal.</long>
      </locale>

      <locale name="pa">
        <short>ਕਾਰਜ ਨੰੂ ਟਰਮੀਨਲ ਵਿੱਚ ਚਲਾੳੁ</short>
        <long>ਸਹੀ, ਜੇਕਰ ਕਾਰਜ ਜੋ ਕਿ ੲਿਸ ਯੂਅਾਰਅੈਲ ਨੰੂ ਵਰਤਦਾ ਹੈ, ਟਰਮੀਨਲ ਵਿੱਚ ਚੱਲੇ ੤</long>
      </locale>

      <locale name="pl">
        <short>Uruchomienie programu w terminalu</short>
        <long>Określa, czy program obsługujący ten adres URL powinien być uruchomiony w terminalu.</long>
      </locale>

      <locale name="pt">
        <short>Executar aplicação na consola</short>
        <long>Verdadeiro se a aplicação para manipular este URL deverá ser executada numa consola.</long>
      </locale>

      <locale name="pt_BR">
        <short>Executar programa em um terminal</short>
